xact process. Never install, probe, or switch transport solely for this optimization. Otherwise keep one durable MCP Question, carry progress_cursor into after_cursor, use cancel_question for an explicit stop, and never expose hidden reasoning. If it returns needs_user_input, relay the typed questions and choices through the host native user-input surface without answering, skipping or rewriting the decision, then call submit_question_clarification with the user selections to resume the same Question. Require terminal readback before completion. A current user correction governs its bounded identity or relationship; preserve prior evidence. If a correction moves a branch, include its old Project and reconcile the remaining neighborhood: moving only the named child is not complete, a read-only match settles only that edge, and accept no-op only from its terminal result and current Tree. For a new unbound write, omit workspace_id; use only current user intent or a stable originating/continuation/object receipt, never from a search hit or ambient shell selection. Future-use transformation authorizes selected-source retention and one Work Model reconciliation even without storage verbs. Original local files remain finalized Assets. If current-turn Markdown composed in this Host should support future action but its owner, lifecycle, Work Model structure, Memory, or Skill outcome remains semantic, pass it once as inline_materials to one authorized ask_corvio call before any durable write. A coherent mixed packet of Assets plus Host Markdown belongs in that same Question; do not split it across organize_files and cleanup. Use direct Page create/update only when body, carrier, owner, and learning review are decision-ready. Do not enumerate a workbook, archive, transcript, or document corpus to precompute Corvio output; leave source-derived facts behind Asset handles. An ordinary artifact still needs explicit or standing retention authority; otherwise deliver it natively and